          "title": "wp2shell: active exploitation of WordPress theme frameworks",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "kind": "prose",
              "text": "wp2shell is a mass exploitation campaign against a widely deployed WordPress theme framework, active since late July. Exploitation is unauthenticated and drops a PHP web shell, with follow-on deployment of a credential harvester on roughly one in five compromised sites. Source: Held corpus, campaign records.",
